Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 16:45:18 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] feat: edits in a linked mod, layout or settings file
 reload it

The home folder's OS watcher (FSEvents, inotify) doesn't follow symlinks, so a
mod or layout kept in its own repo and linked into ~/.config/herdr-app never
reloaded when edited there. At start, links in mods/, layouts/, themes/ and the
three settings files whose targets are outside home are watched too (a linked
file through its folder), and changes there count as the link's path.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
